  "ruleText": "Env-A 2905.06 Price Disclosure. Subject to a claim of confidentiality in accordance with Env-C 208, each affected source shall make available to any person, all information regarding transaction cost and allowance price.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2907.08); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
